{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國影壇盛事《第47屆青龍電影頒獎禮》昨晚在首爾汝矣島KBS電視台舉行，男星玄彬與妻子孫藝珍是去年的影帝和影后得主，兩人分開擔任頒獎嘉賓，其中孫藝珍與8年前合演人氣韓劇《經常請吃飯的漂亮姐姐》的男星丁海寅一起登場，讓粉絲十分驚喜。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.476870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T05:23:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.775403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.775403+00:00","content_hash":"f413e138f88cdbdc525d29a0798e377f6a21ec76c1ae4017c15d408a5f564643","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}